#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Saejima"
msgid "Who's there?"
msgstr "¿Quién es?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Tadokoro"
msgid "Pardon the intrusion."
msgstr "Disculpa la molestia."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Saejima"
msgid "Whaddya want?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Tadokoro"
msgid "More work, of course."
msgstr "Tengo más trabajo, por supuesto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Saejima"
msgid "What now?"
msgstr "¡¿Ahora que?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Tadokoro"
msgid "Let's discuss this somewhere more private, shall we?"
msgstr "Hablemos de esto en un lugar más discreto, ¿te parece?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Saejima"
msgid "Doesn't get more private than my own hideout."
msgstr "No hay lugar más privado que mi escondite."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Tadashi"
msgid "Hi, I'm back!"
msgstr "¡Hola, he vuelto!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Saejima"
msgid "Hey, Tadashi."
msgstr "Hola, Tadashi."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Tadashi"
msgid "You...!"
msgstr "¡Tú!..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Tadokoro"
msgid "Well, hello there, Tadashi-kun. You look well. I'm so glad."
msgstr "Oh, hola, Tadashi-kun. Te ves bien. Me alegro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Tadashi"
msgid "Are you going out on another job, big guy?"
msgstr "¿Saldrás por otro trabajo, grandulón?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Saejima"
msgid "Yep, looks that way. Mind holdin' down the fort\\r\nwhile I'm out?"
msgstr "Sí, eso parece. ¿Te importaría cuidar nuestra\nguarida mientras no estoy?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Tadokoro"
msgid "Actually, I'd like Tadashi-kun to come along this time."
msgstr "En realidad, me gustaría que Tadashi-kun nos acompañe esta vez."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Saejima"
msgid "Best have a good reason."
msgstr "Será mejor que tengas una buena razón para eso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Tadokoro"
msgid "It would just work out well, in a number of ways... But if\\r\nyou'd rather not, we can always call this assignment off."
msgstr "Sería beneficioso en varios aspectos... Pero si no quieres,\npodemos cancelar esta misión."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Saejima"
msgid "What do you think, Tadashi?"
msgstr "¿Qué piensas, Tadashi?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Tadashi"
msgid "I don't mind."
msgstr "Me parece bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Tadokoro"
msgid "Heh. Such a good boy."
msgstr "Je, buen chico."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Saejima"
msgid "So where we headed?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿dónde vamos?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Tadokoro"
msgid "To Underground Coliseum of Purgatory. Are you\\r\nfamiliar with the place, Suzuki-san?"
msgstr "Al Coliseo del purgatorio.\n¿Conoces el lugar, Suzuki-san?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Saejima"
msgid "More or less."
msgstr "Sí, más o menos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "356_Tadokoro"
msgid "Good, then. Your next job will take place there."
msgstr "Genial, entonces. Tu próximo trabajo será ahi."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Tadokoro"
msgid "I'm certain you have preparations to make, so Tadashi-kun\\r\nand I will head out now and meet you there."
msgstr "Seguro que tendrás que prepararte antes de ir, así que\nTadashi-kun y yo, te esperaremos ahí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Saejima"
msgid "As if I'm gonna leave you alone with Tadashi for a second.\\r\nThe kid sticks with me."
msgstr "Como si fuera a dejarte a Tadashi un solo segundo.\nEl chico se queda conmigo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "392_Tadokoro"
msgid "Try to appreciate your position here, Suzuki-san.\\r\nRegardless of the circumstances, I am your client.\\r\nYou work for me."
msgstr "Aprende tu posición, Suzuki-san. Te guste o no.\nSoy tu empleador, tú trabajas para mí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Tadokoro"
msgid "I do believe it's in your best interest to do as I say."
msgstr "Creo que lo mejor es, que las cosas se hagan como yo diga."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "416_Tadashi"
msgid "Don't worry, big guy. I'll be fine."
msgstr "No te preocupes, grandulón. Estaré bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "428_Saejima"
msgid "Alright. Just lemme tell ya one thing."
msgstr "Bueno. Solo déjame decirte una cosa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "440_Tadokoro"
msgid "And what might that be?"
msgstr "¿Qué cosa?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "452_Saejima"
msgid "If you harm so much as a single hair on this kid's head,\\r\nit won't end well for you."
msgstr "Si le tocas un solo pelo al chico, no terminarás nada bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Tadokoro"
msgid "Tadashi-kun is an esteemed customer of mine.\\r\nI'll treat him with the utmost care."
msgstr "Tadashi-kun es un cliente muy estimado para mí.\nLo trataré con el máximo cuidado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "476_Tadokoro"
msgid "If that's all, then, we'll be waiting for you in Purgatory.\\r\nMeet us by the front desk of the arena."
msgstr "Si no hay nada más que decir, entonces te esperaremos en el\nPurgatorio. Búscanos frente a la recepción del coliseo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "548_Saejima"
msgid "(The Underground Coliseum in Purgatory, huh? Sounds like I might hafta fight there again...)"
msgstr "(El Coliseo del purgatorio, ¿eh? Parece que voy a tener que luchar de nuevo...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "560_Saejima"
msgid "(I'm worried about Tadashi. I better hustle to the arena.)"
msgstr "(Me preocupa Tadashi. Será mejor que vaya de una vez al coliseo.)"

